{"schema":1,"id":"claudio","name":"Claudio","wavuName":"Claudio","profile":{"color":"hsl(148 70% 62%)","overview":"Claudio, the flamboyant Italian exorcist, is a simple, straightforward and no-nonsense character who relies on controlling space in order to lock his opponents down, allowing him to setup mixups or pressure. He possesses a limited but effective set of tools to implement this gameplan, allowing the player to quickly achieve character fluency with him and focus on developing their fundamentals and match-up knowledge. In Heat, his mixups become deadlier, with a low Heat Smash and a safe mid launcher.","strengths":["Coverage: b+1 does triple duty as keepout, homing move, and wall splat all in one while being safe","Reliable Punishment: Whiff punishment is incredibly strong thanks to his Heat Engagers and launching options","Locked On: Easy approach with WR2 and f,F+4, the former of which can chip opponents unwilling to duck it","Emergency Buttons: Has access to some of the strongest panic tools in the game under pressure, with db+1+2 and his famous hopkick","Like the Candy: Once attained, Starburst enhances many of his attacks, either making those select moves wall splat or launch, and increases his combo damage via 2,1,2 aerial tailspin","Blue-hot: During Heat, Starburst is always active and he gains a one-time use power low in Heat Smash"],"weaknesses":["Ankle Biter: Lows are either risky (db+4,3, db+3) or slow (SS4), and Heat Smash can still be launched by a few characters","Weak Throw Game: None of his throws break any hazards","Overreliant On Blue Stuff: Below-average combo damage without Starburst or walls","Subpar jabs: Pays for his excellent range with a poor i10 punish and lack of jab extensions"],"stances":["(none)"],"heat":["Can always use Starburst (STB) moves"],"heatEngagers":["3,2","2,1,2","b+4,2","uf+2","wr2"],"heatSmash":["Low, Claudio-H.2+3|startup, Claudio-H.2+3|block"],"launch":["i15 – uf+4, df+1,2","i15 – WS2 (Crouching)"],"chLaunch":["i14 – df+2"],"splat":["i12 – 4,3 (High)","i12 – STB.WS1,2 (Crouching, with Starburst)","i13 – d+1+2 (Mid)","i14 – FC.df+2,1+2 (Crouching, better followups with Starburst or hazards)"],"parry":[],"midCheck":["b+3 (standing)","df+4 (standing)","ws4 (crouching)"],"source":{"name":"Wavu Wiki: Claudio","url":"https://wavu.wiki/t/Claudio","revision":62082,"license":"CC0 1.0"}},"frames":{"characterId":"claudio","source":{"name":"Wavu Wiki","url":"https://wavu.wiki/t/Claudio_movelist","license":"CC0 1.0 (public domain)","revision":63089,"note":"Community-maintained frame data. Values can lag behind the latest patch; verify in Practice mode frame display."},"moves":[{"id":"1,2","num":13,"name":"Scattered Ashes","alt":[],"input":"1,2","parent":"1","hitLevels":["h"],"damage":"12","startup":"i13~14","startupFrame":13,"block":"-3","blockFrame":-3,"blockRange":[-3,-3],"hit":"+8","hitFrame":8,"ch":"","crush":"","recovery":"r20","reach":"2.43","tracks":"","notes":"Jail from 1st attack with 5f delay, Input can be delayed 5f, Move can be delayed 4f","isThrow":false},{"id":"1,3","num":14,"name":"Absolve","alt":[],"input":"1,3","parent":"1","hitLevels":["l"],"damage":"11","startup":"i22","startupFrame":22,"block":"-12","blockFrame":-12,"blockRange":[-12,-12],"hit":"-1","hitFrame":-1,"ch":"","crush":"","recovery":"r31","reach":"3.10","tracks":"","notes":"Combo from 1st CH with 3f delay, Interrupt with i4 from 1st block, Input can be delayed 5f, Move can be delayed 4f","isThrow":false},{"id":"2,1,2","num":15,"name":"Circle of Judgment","alt":[],"input":"2,1,2","parent":"2,1","hitLevels":["m"],"damage":"25","startup":"i16~18","startupFrame":16,"block":"-13","blockFrame":-13,"blockRange":[-13,-13],"hit":"+12a (+3)","hitFrame":12,"ch":"","crush":"","recovery":"r36","reach":"","tracks":"","notes":"Heat Engager, Heat Dash +5, +62a (+42), Strong Aerial Tailspin, Balcony Break, Combo from 2nd CH with 14f delay, Interrupt with i1 from 1st block, Input can be delayed 15f, Move can be delayed 10f, 